  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">220085_DEC Afghanistan Crisis Appeal - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is Phase II of the DEC Afghanistan Crisis Appeal. This project aims to increase access to life-saving health and nutrition services, WASH and protection to crisis affected communities in 2 districts (Kushka Kohna and Kushka Rabat Sangi districts) of Herat Province, through the above stated outcomes.
 
 In summary, the project aims to reach:
 
 - 66,720 women, men and children with health and nutrition services, and protection (Men: 11,081, Women: 20,647, boys: 16,913, Girls: 18,079)
 
 - Approximately 12,250 beneficiaries through WASH activities (Female 5,880, Male 6,370)</narrative>
  </description>
